AppDataKit — in-repo app data fetch kit
=======================================

Vendored into SmartGoldbergEmu as an internal dependency (same pattern as
JsonKit / SteamKit / ExtractKit / StubKit).

Provides Steam app metadata via steamcmd.net, Store DLC name lookup, CDN asset
URL candidates, and Steam Web API helpers for achievements, stats, and items.

No third-party package dependency beyond .NET Framework (System.Net.Http,
System.Web.Extensions).
